# Pandoc WASM raw payload: ~56 MB published build artifact.
# Only the gzipped pandoc-wasm.bin is committed (GitHub Pages serves it).
# See pandoc-wasm/VERSIONS.md for provenance and update steps.
pandoc-wasm/pandoc.wasm

# BusyTeX engine + TeX Live basic tier, release 1.4.0: exactly these 11 files are
# tracked, 128,262,451 bytes in all (busytex.wasm 32.5 MB, texlive-basic.data 92.8 MB,
# each under GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit). GitHub Pages must serve them or image
# handling cannot start. Everything else in core/ stays ignored (biber, other tiers).
# Tracked since 2026-09-30, once the version was pinned (BUSYTEX_VERSION in
# image-extraction/busytex-loader.js). Git history is permanent: replace these files
# only together with that pin, and all from the same release.
# Project notes: auto-image-handling/NOTE-AUTO-IMAGE-HANDLING.md (plan steps 1 and 5)
# and memoize-integration/DESIGN.md sec.3 (the tier decision).
image-extraction/core/*
!image-extraction/core/busytex/
image-extraction/core/busytex/*
!image-extraction/core/busytex/busytex.js
!image-extraction/core/busytex/busytex.wasm
!image-extraction/core/busytex/busytex_biber.js
!image-extraction/core/busytex/busytex_pipeline.js
!image-extraction/core/busytex/busytex_worker.js
!image-extraction/core/busytex/texlive-basic.data
!image-extraction/core/busytex/texlive-basic.js
!image-extraction/core/busytex/texlive-basic.js.providespackage.txt
!image-extraction/core/busytex/texlive-basic.profile
!image-extraction/core/busytex/texlive-basic.txt
!image-extraction/core/busytex/versions.txt
